1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,568
Forty-five years of NASA weather. One field’s first frost: eight days later.

2
00:00:06,168 --> 00:00:10,071
So what do you plant? Each morning, Terrasight says what to do first.

3
00:00:10,968 --> 00:00:15,189
Each rotation faces a hundred and fifty weather runs and ten price scenarios.

4
00:00:15,868 --> 00:00:19,136
Ask why. Every number is checked against the models.

5
00:00:20,268 --> 00:00:22,995
And the models are checked against what really happened.

6
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:25,481
The owner decides in one tap.

7
00:00:27,068 --> 00:00:29,438
From NASA data to tomorrow’s decision.
